{"at": "2026-10-30T17:46:46.266655+00:00", "event_id": "01M66YQP3T82VT84ZG3Q49BFTE", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M66YN65KG6T6S6QRPJRY58M3", "final_answer": "Six kitty-specs/ walkers still decide 'is this a Mission?' for themselves instead of using the shared read-side predicate is_selectable_mission_dir: doctor topology (_collect_topology_rows), _coordination_doctor._resolve_mission_dirs, _review_cycle_reconcile_doctor._mission_dirs_for, materialize._mission_dirs_to_process, charter_activate._collect_inflight_missions and release.changelog.build_changelog_block. Residue folders (no meta.json, or an untracked id-less meta.json) are therefore listed, scanned or processed as Missions, and each walker's local rule can drift from the one authority (#6758, follow-up to #5875).", "mission_id": "01M66YN5JQ1MA9ACTFX7XHWGW6", "mission_slug": "route-kitty-specs-walkers-through-the-mission-predicate", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-30T17:46:46.266655Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M66YN65KG6T6S6QRPJRY58M3", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-30T17:46:46.265925Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-10-30T17:46:48.825060+00:00", "event_id": "01M66YQRKST2TMR87J3844YKKW", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M66YN6J1ESJ2CYE5J3BJGQHJ", "final_answer": "Every one of the six walkers decides per child through is_selectable_mission_dir (one git probe per walk at most), so a residue folder never appears as a Mission in any of them; doctor topology no longer prints residue rows with 'meta.json not found'; each changed walker has a test with a residue child and a selectable Mission that would fail on a walker-local rule; and an architectural gate fails if any of the six loses the predicate call.", "mission_id": "01M66YN5JQ1MA9ACTFX7XHWGW6", "mission_slug": "route-kitty-specs-walkers-through-the-mission-predicate", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-30T17:46:48.825060Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M66YN6J1ESJ2CYE5J3BJGQHJ", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-30T17:46:48.824189Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-10-30T17:46:51.153717+00:00", "event_id": "01M66YQTWHKBQZTZCDDTS1XDRE", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M66YN6XXTWY11XDV0SB96A7K", "final_answer": "Out of scope: the audit engine's deliberately looser is_mission_dir population (src/specify_cli/audit/engine.py, #6757 owns it); any new residue reporting surface (doctor identity keeps that role); the predicate's own rule and the write-seam is_kitty_specs_residue call sites that already route through it; and walkers outside the six the issue names.", "mission_id": "01M66YN5JQ1MA9ACTFX7XHWGW6", "mission_slug": "route-kitty-specs-walkers-through-the-mission-predicate", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-30T17:46:51.153717Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M66YN6XXTWY11XDV0SB96A7K", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-30T17:46:51.152898Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
